sequenceDiagram
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant MCP as MCP App
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DET as Deterministic<br/>Services
    participant WS as WorldState
    participant SUP as AI Supervisor

    rect rgb(240, 244, 255)
    Note over GH,SUP: 1 · Sync
    GH->>MCP: Issues (via gh CLI)
    MCP->>BE: POST /api/issues/sync
    BE->>BE: Store in IssueCache
    end

    rect rgb(232, 248, 240)
    Note over GH,SUP: 2 · Analyze
    BE->>DET: Classify + measure
    DET-->>WS: 4 buckets · Chaos 0–10 · Compliance 100→0
    WS->>WS: Build 12 capped variables → Stress 0–100 (BEFORE)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 244, 224)
    Note over GH,SUP: 3 · Reshape (deterministic pre-pass + AI)
    WS->>BE: WorldState + issues
    BE->>BE: Pre-pass: triageUrgent(n) for every<br/>unassigned-urgent issue (no LLM)
    BE->>BE: Pre-pass: defuseChaosInputs(clock)<br/>fills empty bodies + normalises updatedAt
    BE->>SUP: Hand off (chaos already defused)
    SUP->>SUP: Supervisor → 6 sub-agents → @Tool mutations<br/>(Triage · Defer · Delegate · Classify · Scope · Wellness)
    SUP-->>BE: Mutation plan + explanation
    end

    rect rgb(255, 232, 240)
    Note over GH,SUP: 4 · Apply, Recalculate, Output
    BE->>BE: Apply mutations to IssueCache<br/>(AddLabels · RemoveLabels · Comment · Unassign · SetBody · SetUpdatedAt)
    BE->>DET: Recalculate on mutated issues
    DET-->>WS: New stress score (AFTER)
    BE->>BE: Protective check (stress ≥ 70?) + Friday score
    BE-->>MCP: Plan + flamegraph + interventions
    MCP->>GH: Apply labels & comments
    end
